---
title: Kitchen Operations & Queue Management Flow
config:
  theme: default
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant OM as Order Manager
    participant KS as Kitchen Service
    participant KQM as Kitchen Queue Manager
    participant K1 as Grill Kitchen
    participant K2 as Fryer Kitchen
    participant K3 as Beverage Station
    participant K4 as Dessert Station
    participant WS as WebSocket Handler
    participant BM as Branch Manager
    participant FCM as Firebase Messaging
    participant C as Customer

    Note over OM, C: Order Processing Initiation
    OM->>+KS: ProcessNewOrder(order)
    KS->>KQM: AnalyzeOrderItems(orderItems)
    KQM->>KQM: Categorize items by kitchen type
    
    Note over KQM, K4: Kitchen Assignment Logic
    loop For each order item
        alt Grilled Items (burgers, steaks)
            KQM->>K1: AddToGrillQueue(item, priority)
            K1->>K1: Calculate cooking time
            K1-->>KQM: Queue position & estimated time
        
        else Fried Items (fries, nuggets)
            KQM->>K2: AddToFryerQueue(item, priority)
            K2->>K2: Check fryer capacity
            K2-->>KQM: Queue position & estimated time
        
        else Beverages (drinks, smoothies)
            KQM->>K3: AddToBeverageQueue(item, priority)
            K3->>K3: Check ingredient availability
            K3-->>KQM: Queue position & estimated time
        
        else Desserts (ice cream, cakes)
            KQM->>K4: AddToDessertQueue(item, priority)
            K4->>K4: Check preparation requirements
            K4-->>KQM: Queue position & estimated time
        end
    end
    
    KQM->>OM: CalculateOverallOrderTime()
    OM->>OM: Determine order completion estimate
    KS-->>-OM: Kitchen processing initiated

    Note over OM, C: Real-time Kitchen Dashboard Updates
    KQM->>WS: NotifyKitchenQueueUpdate()
    WS->>BM: Real-time queue status
    BM->>BM: Display kitchen workload visualization
    
    OM->>FCM: NotifyCustomerOrderInProgress()
    FCM->>C: Order being prepared notification

    Note over OM, C: Parallel Kitchen Processing
    par Grill Kitchen Operations
        loop Process Grill Queue
            K1->>K1: Start cooking next item
            K1->>K1: Monitor cooking progress
            K1->>WS: NotifyItemStarted()
            WS->>BM: Item cooking notification
            
            K1->>K1: Item cooking completed
            BM->>API: POST /api/order/check-prepared/{branchId}/grill/{unit}
            API->>KQM: MarkItemPrepared(grill, unit)
            KQM->>KQM: Move to completed items
            KQM->>WS: NotifyItemCompleted()
            WS->>BM: Item ready notification
        end
    
    and Fryer Kitchen Operations
        loop Process Fryer Queue
            K2->>K2: Start frying next batch
            K2->>K2: Monitor frying time & temperature
            K2->>WS: NotifyFryingStarted()
            WS->>BM: Fryer status update
            
            K2->>K2: Frying completed
            BM->>API: POST /api/order/check-prepared/{branchId}/fryer/{unit}
            API->>KQM: MarkItemPrepared(fryer, unit)
            KQM->>KQM: Update fryer queue
            KQM->>WS: NotifyFryerReady()
            WS->>BM: Fried items ready
        end
    
    and Beverage Station Operations
        loop Process Beverage Queue
            K3->>K3: Prepare beverages
            K3->>K3: Check ingredient levels
            
            alt Ingredients Available
                K3->>K3: Complete beverage preparation
                BM->>API: POST /api/order/check-prepared/{branchId}/beverage/{unit}
                API->>KQM: MarkItemPrepared(beverage, unit)
                KQM->>WS: NotifyBeverageReady()
                WS->>BM: Beverage completed
            else Ingredients Low
                K3->>WS: NotifyIngredientShortage()
                WS->>BM: Ingredient shortage alert
                BM->>BM: Request ingredient restock
            end
        end
    
    and Dessert Station Operations
        loop Process Dessert Queue
            K4->>K4: Prepare dessert items
            K4->>K4: Assembly and presentation
            K4->>K4: Quality check
            
            K4->>K4: Dessert ready
            BM->>API: POST /api/order/check-prepared/{branchId}/dessert/{unit}
            API->>KQM: MarkItemPrepared(dessert, unit)
            KQM->>WS: NotifyDessertReady()
            WS->>BM: Dessert completed notification
        end
    end

    Note over OM, C: Order Completion Coordination
    KQM->>KQM: Monitor all kitchen stations
    
    loop Check Order Completion
        KQM->>OM: CheckOrderReadiness(orderId)
        OM->>OM: Verify all items completed
        
        alt All Items Ready
            OM->>OM: Mark order as ready
            OM->>FCM: NotifyCustomerOrderReady()
            FCM->>C: Order ready for pickup
            OM->>WS: NotifyOrderReady()
            WS->>BM: Order completion alert
            
            Note over BM, C: Final Assembly & Quality Check
            BM->>BM: Perform final quality inspection
            BM->>BM: Package order for delivery/pickup
            BM->>API: PUT /api/order/finalize/{orderId}
            API->>OM: FinalizeOrder()
            OM->>OM: Generate order invoice
            
        else Items Still Pending
            KQM->>WS: NotifyPartialCompletion()
            WS->>BM: Progress update
        end
    end

    Note over OM, C: Kitchen Performance Analytics
    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        KQM->>KQM: Track preparation times
        KQM->>KQM: Monitor queue efficiency
        KQM->>KQM: Calculate kitchen utilization
        
        KS->>KS: Generate performance reports
        KS->>WS: SendPerformanceMetrics()
        WS->>BM: Kitchen analytics dashboard
        
        Note over KS, BM: Performance Metrics Include:
        Note over KS, BM: • Average preparation time per item type
        Note over KS, BM: • Kitchen station utilization rates
        Note over KS, BM: • Peak hour analysis
        Note over KS, BM: • Ingredient consumption tracking
        Note over KS, BM: • Order completion time trends
    end

    Note over OM, C: Kitchen Error Handling
    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        Note over K1, K4: Equipment Failure Scenarios
        alt Kitchen Equipment Malfunction
            K1->>K1: Detect equipment failure
            K1->>WS: NotifyEquipmentFailure()
            WS->>BM: Equipment failure alert
            BM->>KQM: RedistributeQueue(failedKitchen)
            KQM->>K2: TransferGrillItemsToBackup()
            KQM->>FCM: NotifyOrderDelay()
            FCM->>C: Estimated delay notification
        end
        
        Note over K1, K4: Ingredient Shortage
        alt Critical Ingredient Missing
            K3->>K3: Detect ingredient shortage
            K3->>WS: NotifyShortage(ingredient)
            WS->>BM: Ingredient shortage alert
            BM->>OM: CheckAffectedOrders(ingredient)
            OM->>FCM: NotifyIngredientUnavailable()
            FCM->>C: Item substitution options
        end
        
        Note over K1, K4: Order Modification
        alt Customer Modifies Order
            C->>FCM: Request order modification
            FCM->>OM: ProcessOrderChange()
            OM->>KQM: UpdateKitchenQueues()
            KQM->>K1: RemoveFromQueue(oldItem)
            KQM->>K2: AddToQueue(newItem)
            KQM->>WS: NotifyQueueChange()
            WS->>BM: Order modification update
        end
    end

    Note over OM, C: Kitchen Capacity Management
    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        KQM->>KQM: Monitor kitchen load
        
        alt High Demand Period
            KQM->>OM: NotifyHighDemand()
            OM->>OM: Implement delay estimation
            OM->>FCM: NotifyExtendedWaitTimes()
            FCM->>C: Updated delivery times
            
            BM->>API: PUT /api/kitchen/boost-capacity
            API->>KQM: ActivateBoostMode()
            KQM->>K1: IncreaseCookingParallelism()
            KQM->>K2: OptimizeFryerBatches()
        end
        
        alt Low Demand Period
            KQM->>KQM: Optimize energy usage
            KQM->>K1: ReduceStandbyPower()
            KQM->>OM: SuggestMenuPromotion()
            OM->>FCM: SendPromotionalOffers()
            FCM->>C: Special offers notification
        end
    end
